{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0044_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0044_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "ee5b6c908792319c17dd3cd1a6294c775bff963b721d5adcc4e30589eebb9991", "ja": "ライブMC　～バトンをつなげ！～", "zh": "演唱会主持　～接棒下去！～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0044_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0044_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "ab69dffb85b6fc8511f89897b563b9fe13a8b2823aa5c42242452c02250e25cd", "ja": "ライブ慣れしている亜美、真美、杏奈は、\n軽快なトークで観客をアオっていく。そんな\n3人にマイクを向けられた紬は、アイドルに\nなってから、これまでの想いを語り、\n杏奈達にMCのバトンを返すのだった。", "zh": "习惯演唱会气氛的亚美、真美、杏奈，\n以轻快的对话带动观众情绪。\n接着，䌷接到这三人递上的麦克风，\n便道出自己成为偶像至今的感想，\n随后把主持棒交还给杏奈她们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0044_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0044_story_06_1000_011ami", "source_sha256": "f01b86b904a54ef8ca2bbf4e075ba33dfc729e7a1eb1de4c3e98dcae8c391bd2", "ja": "イエーイっ！\n会場の兄ちゃん姉ちゃん達、楽しんでるかーい！？", "zh": "耶～！\n会场里的大哥哥、大姊姊们，大家有嗨起来吗～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0044_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0044_story_06_1001_012mam", "source_sha256": "a94abd796d9e32ced5e6379139e0413dbc37e81e6deaada71bc6827bdc72c355", "ja": "うむ……なかなか盛り上がってるみたいだけど、\n真美的にはまだ足りないかなー。どうだね、亜美くん？", "zh": "嗯……好像还挺嗨的样子喔，\n但在真美看来还不太够耶～你觉得呢亚美老妹？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0044_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0044_story_06_1002_011ami", "source_sha256": "06639062f6564081760127ff55342fb1f93155d77d0f87dc64903c5a8bab1961", "ja": "そうですなぁ、真美くん！\nここは1発、もっちーに決めてもらおー☆", "zh": "就是说啊，真美老姊！\n这里就请望望来炒热一下气氛吧～☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0044_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0044_story_06_1003_024ann", "source_sha256": "7c81e78b1b0353b61340267bcd0c3497270905e89b87103a11c84856135105af", "ja": "はーい！　杏奈にビビッとおまかせだよ☆\nみんな、準備はいい？　それじゃ、いくよー！", "zh": "好～！充满活力地交给杏奈吧☆\n大家，准备好了吗？那么要来啰～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0044_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0044_story_06_1004_024ann", "source_sha256": "8108217d51dff3ee95fab02e2860a8c0378c941505633210f0b721d4fb577ea4", "ja": "イェーイ！　みんな、杏奈達この後のステージも\nすごく頑張るから、たくさんの応援ください！", "zh": "耶～！大家，杏奈我们接下来的表演也会非常努力，\n请大家多多为我们加油喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0044_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0044_story_06_1005_012mam", "source_sha256": "a7e2802c1ed280cf0221398ddbe116e8808a8fec3002921b92d2c86eec7aaf5d", "ja": "さっすが、もっちー！　ビビッと決まったね～！\nよーし、つむりん！　この調子でいってみよ～！", "zh": "真不愧是望望！充满活力地炒热了气氛呢～！\n很好～䌷䌷！你也照这种感觉来试试看吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0044_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0044_story_06_1006_051tmg", "source_sha256": "8da18eb9b2e8e45b4307d6185bbee97072e1785b727c7a91a89c02a651a76038", "ja": "えっ！？　う、うちも……？\nけど、なんて言ったらいいんか……。", "zh": "咦！？人、人家也要……？\n可是人家不知该说啥来着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0044_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0044_story_06_1007_024ann", "source_sha256": "83a9a8844fe4e5c781e41c8c4dba84be3f7f71ce11c01e483ec8034b719aa3e2", "ja": "紬さん、ファイト！\n自分の気持ちを、そのまま伝えればいいんだよ☆", "zh": "小䌷，加油！\n只要照实说出自己的心情就好啰☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0044_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0044_story_06_1008_051tmg", "source_sha256": "ef5575c241268d137103c46b74a9586c96d9aa6963c21e383692a98a36491d09", "ja": "自分の気持ちを……わかりました。\nあの……皆さん、本当にありがとうございます。", "zh": "说出自己的心情……我知道了。\n那个……大家，真的很谢谢你们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0044_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0044_story_06_1009_051tmg", "source_sha256": "ddbf0e143dba6eda73ba77adc700173754f31434f5d20c1ce545403394b3c751", "ja": "上京して、右も左もわからない状態から\nここまで歩いて来られたのも、ひとえに……。", "zh": "刚来到东京，连东西南北都分不清的我，\n能在那个状态下一路走到这里，都是因为……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0044_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0044_story_06_1010_051tmg", "source_sha256": "30471331e2d7c3a6a9532a67f9cf36a4414b728110f4ac10e73a10b3a79d0602", "ja": "劇場の仲間たちと……そして、応援してくださる\n皆さんのおかげです。あとは……望月さん。", "zh": "多亏有剧场的伙伴们……\n还有支持着我的大家。再来就交给……望月。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0044_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0044_story_06_1011_024ann", "source_sha256": "d690a2df8b2ab83941f7316646986a92d78ec2adc08ac0b99da41b6d5ebd2524", "ja": "オッケー！　亜美ちゃん、真美ちゃん！\n紬さんのバトン、杏奈たちで繋げるよ♪", "zh": "OK！亚美、真美！\n小䌷的主持棒，就由杏奈我们接棒下去吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0044_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0044_story_06_1012_011ami", "source_sha256": "6b9a9f1d1880527514e20ce3fc90c8a12385e6f92b19ee1063441c2e4d585258", "ja": "ブラジャー！　あ、間違えた。ブラボー！\nつむりんの気持ち、みんなにドキュンと伝わったよね！", "zh": "Brassiere！啊，搞错了，Bravo！\n䌷䌷的心意深深打动了大家的心呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0044_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0044_story_06_1013_012mam", "source_sha256": "34d599d1b11b8944314db33c06445ba25ebe1adbf384a748145f5efcb633676e", "ja": "うんうん！　それじゃ、おしゃべりここまで！\nここからはノンストップでいくよ！", "zh": "嗯嗯！那么就聊到这里吧！\n接下来要一路冲下去不停歇啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0044_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0044_story_06_1014_011ami", "source_sha256": "7968e6b0215005efdcc56e30afe417600bf833dc35021dba0c615409bf1af42f", "ja": "兄ちゃん姉ちゃん達？　亜美達に振り落とされない\nように、しっかりついてくるのだ～！", "zh": "大哥哥、大姊姊们！\n要紧紧跟上，别被亚美我们甩飞啰～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
